      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>ArgumentPreparedStatementSetter</code> for the given arguments.",
      "translation": "为给定的参数创建一个新的<code>ArgumentPreparedStatementSetter</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Close the resources allocated by parameters that the implementing\nobject holds, for example in case of a DisposableSqlTypeValue\n(like an SqlLobValue).",
